Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi,
The sentence in the review paper is a bit unclear. It should really say that the “basic” construction of the SPDE/GMRF representation works for integer alpha, but that further techniques can yield GMRF approximations also for non-integer alpha.
The current implementation for fractional alpha values is based on the spectral approximation technique discussed in the Authors’ Response in the Discussion of the Lindgren, Rue, Lindström 2011 JRSSB paper (see references in the review paper).

Finn

